 The sponsorships are kind of an additional way for us to make it possible for more kids

01:23:01.260 --> 01:23:06.340
 and keep the costs down, but I think we all knew that it wasn't going to be covered solely

01:23:06.340 --> 01:23:09.040
 by registration fees and sponsorships.

01:23:09.620 --> 01:23:13.800
 So I think we went into it knowing that that would be the case.

