 Because otherwise, I mean, it's not really serving the purpose of the sponsorship to be

01:23:43.240 --> 01:23:46.400
 able to provide scholarships for the people who are participating in it.

01:23:46.880 --> 01:23:50.840
 You're spreading it too thin for too long of a period of time over too many sports.

01:23:51.440 --> 01:23:57.060
 Part of that, too, is that they were going to be reversible jerseys so that that could

01:23:57.060 --> 01:24:02.200
 last the full year and get a little bit more mileage out of it for the families.

