 We could take it to just the one half of the season, basically, or the fall, like, is done.

01:24:12.700 --> 01:24:18.840
 But it would cover less then, because we have to get the jerseys anyway, the way they are.

01:24:19.020 --> 01:24:24.380
 So I guess to me, I'm also looking at, this is kind of like a pilot program, and we're

01:24:24.380 --> 01:24:28.140
 going to let them proof of concept, bring it back to us, and then we're going to make

01:24:28.140 --> 01:24:30.420
 tweaks and adjustments and refine it.

01:24:32.040 --> 01:24:40.120
 Just to, I know it seems like it's thin, but is a registration fee $60, roughly?

01:24:40.220 --> 01:24:41.100
 Does that sound right?

01:24:42.260 --> 01:24:42.500
 Yeah.

01:24:42.860 --> 01:24:43.820
 Yeah, we're right around there.

01:24:44.060 --> 01:24:44.800
 Right around $60.

01:24:45.440 --> 01:24:52.920
 If we can use some of that sponsorship money to offset fees for the jerseys, then that lowers

01:24:52.920 --> 01:24:54.340
 our prices down.

01:24:54.360 --> 01:24:56.780
 Well, that's kind of where I was going.

01:24:57.020 --> 01:25:01.840
 I mean, I don't know the intent of the council, if it's just to lower the price for everyone,

01:25:02.080 --> 01:25:06.120
 or if it's to sponsor kids that maybe wouldn't otherwise be able to play because they can't

01:25:06.120 --> 01:25:12.540
 afford it, that's 10%, it's $116, that's $60, $7,000, that you could sponsor fully.

01:25:13.040 --> 01:25:17.540
 And there's a possibility of a 50% would make that over 200 kids.

01:25:17.580 --> 01:25:21.880
 That's over 10% to 20% of the kids would get in for free or half price.

01:25:22.160 --> 01:25:28.720
 So I think it goes a little bit further than maybe anticipated because 70, 80, 90% of kids

01:25:28.720 --> 01:25:32.160
 are going to pay the full registration and that covers their costs.

01:25:32.440 --> 01:25:38.200
 So 120 kids would get in absolutely for free with this program.

01:25:38.700 --> 01:25:44.960
 Well, except for, I think the intent that Jason's talking about is the sponsorship will help

01:25:44.960 --> 01:25:53.180
 keep the overall registration for everyone down because it eats the cost of the jersey, but

01:25:53.180 --> 01:25:59.000
 then the remainder helps to cover scholarships for kids that wouldn't otherwise be able to

01:25:59.000 --> 01:25:59.380
 do it.

01:26:00.220 --> 01:26:06.340
 So I can tell, that's the intent for me, is that the registration, we keep it low.

01:26:07.120 --> 01:26:12.040
 If we're going to do a jersey that's reversible, we should be supporting that being the same

01:26:12.040 --> 01:26:15.620
 jersey because that keeps the cost down for participants to continue to use it year after

01:26:15.620 --> 01:26:15.900
 year.

