 If we're trying to change out sponsorships every year on that, then they're no longer an

01:26:21.200 --> 01:26:25.820
 interchangeable shirt that can be used for multiple sports, by the way, which I think

01:26:25.820 --> 01:26:30.060
 in one of the things, I'll give some credit to how Saratoga Springs is doing that part of

01:26:30.060 --> 01:26:33.080
 it, that is smart because those jerseys are used for every sport.

01:26:33.080 --> 01:26:38.700
 And that does keep the cost down for, especially people who have multiple kids that are playing

01:26:38.700 --> 01:26:41.580
 that, they just hand me down to the kids and they can play with their blue and white

01:26:41.580 --> 01:26:42.180
 jerseys.

