 So my intent was access fee, keep that low, have them buy the jersey that's reversible that

01:26:49.620 --> 01:26:50.820
 can be used for multiple sports.

01:26:51.420 --> 01:26:56.680
 And the way that it would work too is that it even says in the sponsorship agreement that

01:26:56.680 --> 01:26:58.200
 the jerseys are reusable.

01:26:58.920 --> 01:27:03.800
 And so the next year, there's a chance that their logo may not be on every single jersey.

01:27:04.160 --> 01:27:08.040
 And they have to be okay with that so that they can use the ones from the last season.

01:27:14.040 --> 01:27:19.340
 So do we feel like this is in a place that we can leave it on the consent agenda or is there

01:27:19.340 --> 01:27:19.920
 more discussion?

