01:48:59.860 --> 01:49:02.200
 And so we got those last, I think, Thursday.

01:49:02.500 --> 01:49:05.540
 So we made the amendments so that they were in the packet.

01:49:05.540 --> 01:49:17.220
 Those percentages and stuff would only change if the council chose to change the dollar amount of revenue that is being proposed to come from property taxes as part of the budget process.

01:49:20.280 --> 01:49:21.520
